            </li>
            <li class="tab" data-tab="content2">life as an agriculturalist</li>
            <li class="tab" data-tab="content3">the human rights champion</li>
            <li class="tab" data-tab="content4">the activist for peace</li>
            <li class="tab" data-tab="content5">A story of resilience</li>
            <li class="tab" data-tab="content6">life as a diplomat</li>
            <li class="tab" data-tab="content7">
